"""Writes takeoff2/mep.csv for the Hollywood Comedy Club MEP take-off (Mechanical, Plumbing,
Electrical power, Lighting, Low Voltage). Every row cites the document it was read from.
Linear feet come from measure_runs.py (37.5 px/ft at 3/16" = 1'-0" on the 200-dpi renders;
25 px/ft on the 1/8" M-4 section); panel circuit counts from summarize_panels.py over
panels_extracted.csv; RCP tag counts from count_rcp_tags.py.
Usage: python3 -I build_mep_csv.py <out.csv>
"""
